prediction:
In order to enable HttpOnly and Secure flags on web application deployed on WebLogic Server, follow below steps: 

1) Create a new policy file named "weblogic.policy" under $WLS_HOME/user_projects/domains/<domain_name>/config directory. 
2) Add the following lines inside the policy file: 

<java.security.permission> 
grant { 
permission java.lang.reflect.FieldPermission "javax.servlet.http.HttpSession", "write"; 
} 
</java.security.permission> 

3) Restart the server.

